---
description: Progress checklist and time estimate for every build task
alwaysApply: true
---
Before writing any code:
1. Read the task and post a numbered checklist of every step, including deploy and verification.
2. Next to each step, give a rough time estimate (e.g. ~5 min) and a total at the top.
3. Flag anything that needs my input before you start.

While working:
- After finishing each step, repost the checklist with ✅ done, 🔄 in progress, ⬜ not started, plus "X of Y done, about N min left".
- If a step takes much longer than estimated, say why and give a new estimate.

At the end:
- Post the final checklist, what was deployed, and anything not done or uncertain.
